---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Directorate of Human Resources" 
  subtitle="Building institutional capacity through people — recruitment, welfare, and staff development."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4881.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Administration', href: '/administration' },
    { label: 'Human Resources', href: '/administration/human-resource' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={`${styles.contentWrapper} ${styles.splitLayout}`}>

    <!-- Sticky Sidebar / Profile -->
    <aside class={styles.stickySidebar}>
      <div class={styles.vcImgWrap}>
        <img
          src="/media/director_human_resource.webp"
          alt="Mallam Umar Ali, Senior Deputy Registrar / Head, Human Resource Department, FUAZ"
        />
      </div>
      <h2 class={styles.vcTitle}>Mallam Umar Ali</h2>
      <p class={styles.vcRole}>Senior Deputy Registrar</p>
      <p class={styles.vcRole} style="margin-top:0.3rem; color:#555; font-size:0.85rem; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0; font-weight:600;">Head, Human Resource Department</p>

      <!-- Profile Details -->
      <ul class="sidebar-details">
        <li>
          <span class="detail-label">Qualification</span>
          <span class="detail-value">M.Sc. Labour &amp; Industrial Relations</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="detail-label">Assumed Office</span>
          <span class="detail-value">27th May, 2025</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="detail-label">Category</span>
          <span class="detail-value">Head of Department (HOD)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="detail-label">Dept. Established</span>
          <span class="detail-value">2021</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div>
      <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Biography</h2>
      <p class={`${styles.paragraph} ${styles.dropCap}`}>
        Mallam Umar Ali is a distinguished university administrator and human resource strategist,
        currently serving as the <strong>Senior Deputy Registrar and Head of the Human Resource Department</strong>
        at the Federal University of Agriculture, Zuru (FUAZ). Since the establishment of the
        department in 2021, it has functioned as the backbone of institutional governance, ensuring staff
        welfare, professional development, and effective administrative oversight.
      </p>

      <p class={styles.paragraph}>
        Under his visionary leadership, the department recorded landmark achievements in 2025 through
        the successful execution of a comprehensive <strong>University Staff Audit</strong>. This exercise verified and
        streamlined the University Nominal Roll, thereby strengthening personnel management and
        reinforcing institutional accountability.
      </p>

      <blockquote class={styles.blockquote}>
        "Currently spearheading the department's transition toward full digitalisation of the Nominal Roll — designed to modernise HR workflows, enhance data integrity, and enable data-driven decision-making across the university."
      </blockquote>

      <p class={styles.paragraph}>
        He holds a Master of Science degree in Labour and Industrial Relations and continues to champion
        excellence in strategic HR management, industrial relations, and institutional governance.
      </p>

      <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Areas of Specialisation</h2>
      <ul class={styles.list}>
        <li><strong>Strategic Human Resource Management &amp; Institutional Governance</strong></li>
        <li><strong>University Nominal Roll Management &amp; Personnel Auditing</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Industrial Relations, Staff Discipline, and Dispute Resolution</strong></li>
        <li><strong>HR Digitalisation &amp; Administrative Process Automation</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Key Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul class={styles.list}>
        <li><strong>Staff Recruitment &amp; Appointments:</strong> Managing open competitive recruitment for academic, senior administrative, technical, and junior staff positions in conformity with established Federal Government guidelines.</li>
        <li><strong>Establishment &amp; Confirmation:</strong> Processing probationary appointments, staff confirmations, and maintaining the university's approved establishment records.</li>
        <li><strong>Promotions &amp; Advancement:</strong> Coordinating Annual Performance Evaluation Reports (APER) and facilitating staff promotion exercises across all cadres.</li>
        <li><strong>Nominal Roll Management:</strong> Overseeing the integrity, accuracy, and ongoing digitalisation of the University Nominal Roll and staff records database.</li>
        <li><strong>Staff Welfare &amp; Discipline:</strong> Overseeing welfare matters, processing disciplinary cases in line with the Public Service Rules, and managing exit protocols including retirement and disengagement.</li>
        <li><strong>Leave Administration:</strong> Processing and monitoring all categories of staff leave — annual, study, maternity, casual, and sabbatical.</li>
        <li><strong>Training &amp; Development:</strong> Identifying training needs and facilitating capacity-building programmes, workshops, and professional development opportunities for all staff cadres.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Registry Sub-Units</h2>
      <ul class={styles.list}>
        <li><strong>Senior Staff Unit:</strong> Handles matters relating to CONTISS 07 and above (CONUASS 01 and above for academic staff), including deployment, transfer, and inter-cadre progression.</li>
        <li><strong>Junior Staff Unit:</strong> Manages the establishment, recruitment, and welfare of junior non-academic staff (CONTISS 01–06) across all university departments.</li>
        <li><strong>Staff Development Unit:</strong> Processes study fellowships, conference attendance, and formal further-education leaves for eligible staff.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class={styles.importantBox}>
        <strong>Staff Matters Enquiries:</strong> All staff seeking information on appointments, promotions, leave, or welfare should visit the Human Resource Department at the Registry Building, FUAZ Main Campus, Zuru, during official working hours — <em>8:00 am to 4:00 pm, Monday to Friday</em>.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Sidebar detail list ────────────────────────── */
  .sidebar-details {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .sidebar-details li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .detail-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #999;
  }

  .detail-value {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
